   - **Total dose = (20 mg/kg) × (14.51 kg)**
   - Total dose ≈ 290.2 mg

3. **Calculate the time (in minutes):**
   - **Time = Total dose / Inference rate**
   - Time = 290.2 mg / (0.5 mg/kg/min × 14.51 kg)
   - Time ≈ 290.2 / 7.255
   - Time ≈ 40 minutes

