\[
\frac{0.044 \text{ g NaF}}{100 \text{ mL solution}} = \frac{x \text{ g NaF}}{10 \text{ mL solution}}
\]
\[
x = \frac{0.044 \times 10}{100} = 0.0044 \text{ g NaF}
\]
Convert grams to milligrams:
\[
0.0044 \text{ g} \times 1000 \text{ mg/g} = 4.4 \text{ mg NaF}
\]

