- U is the lattice energy
- A is the Boltzmann constant (2.21 x 10^-19 J nm)
- \( z_+\) and \( z_-\) are the charges of the ions (Ca2+ and Cl-), so \( z^+ = 2 \) and \( z^- = 1 \).
