\[
i(0) = 0.2e^{-4(0)} = 0.2 \, \text{A}
\]
The current is related to the current through the capacitor by:
\[
i(t) = C \frac{dv(t)}{dt}
\]
Substituting the given values:
\[
0.2e^{-4t} = C \frac{d(10e^{-4t})}{dt} = C(-40e^{-4t})
\]
