\ln(10^5) = 0.0003 E_a
\]
\[
5 \ln(10) = 0.0003 E_a
\]
\[
E_a = \frac{5 \ln(10)}{0.0003}
\]
Using \( \ln(10) \approx 2.303 \):

\[
E_a = \frac{5 \times 2.303}{0.0003} = \frac{11.515}{0.0003} \approx 38383.33 \, \text{cal/mol}
