   W_hot = Q_out = 544 kJ/kg
   The work done is:
   W_in = η * Q_out = 0.56 * 544 kJ/kg = 304.64 kJ/kg
   The heat supplied is:
   Q_in = W_in + Q_out = 304.64 kJ/kg + 544 kJ/kg = 848.64 kJ/kg

   The heat supplied is also given by:
